Users:
{% if multi_line_clips | default(false) %}
- Each audio clip is a stretch of the room conversation and can hold several speakers' lines in a row. Decide about the most recent line, at the end of the final clip: respond when that line is spoken to you or asks you to act, even if the lines before it were not for you; treat the earlier lines as context.
